{
  "format": 1,
  "about": "r46-fix part 2 (FOC46-03, the driver's rule of 2026-10-13): a new recorded take ships within 1.5 dB of the sound it replaces on live (d5bf2206), as the game plays it. Written by the build lane (tools/audio/sfx-levels-audit.mjs measures, the re-level was done on the lane's mastered files); nobody has heard it (rule 13).",
